message: "If you use this proof archive, please cite it."
title: "The Exact Smoothing Cutoff for a Three-Factor Cyclotomic Tensor"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For fixed positive side ratios and fixed positive error tolerance, the three-factor tensor smoothing width has exact squared-width offset minus log c-star. This does not identify the shrinking critical window or a total-variation cutoff."
